            <h3>Idempotency</h3>
            <p>Use a unique <code>ref_id</code> per transaction. Duplicates return <code>DUPLICATE_ORDER</code>.</p>
            <h3>Webhook Reliability</h3>
            <p>Callbacks may be delayed. Always poll the Query API for authoritative status.</p>
            <h3>Signature Security</h3>
            <p>Keep your Secret Key server-side only. Never expose it in client code.</p>
            <h3>Retry Strategy</h3>
            <p>For timeouts or 5xx errors, retry after 5–10s with max 3 attempts.</p>
            <% } %>
        </section>

